                                                "sense_id": "7845cb66-bcfd-325d-bcdd-87f1797ed87b",
                                                "text": "Many of the initial responses to GPT-4’s exam prowess were predictably immoderate: AI can keep up with human lawyers, or apply to Stanford, or make “education” useless."
